%% Treasury Program — CPI sequence at company creation
%% Source: treasury-program-design.md §6
%% Atomicity: entire flow runs in one tx; any failure reverts everything.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operator (FE)
    participant Reg as Registry Program
    participant Tre as Treasury Program
    participant CA as CompanyAccount PDA
    participant TA as TreasuryAccount PDA
    participant PA as PolicyAccount PDA

    Op->>+Reg: create_company(name, controlling_authority, …)

    Reg->>+CA: allocate + rent-fund + init
    Note over CA: treasury = Pubkey::default()<br/>policy   = Pubkey::default()<br/>(placeholders, will be overwritten)
    CA-->>-Reg: ok

    Reg->>+Tre: CPI · init_treasury(company_pda)

    Tre->>+TA: derive PDA<br/>seeds = ["treasury", company_pda]<br/>allocate + rent-fund
    Note over TA: company = company_pda<br/>accepted_assets = [SOL_PSEUDO_MINT]<br/>version = 1
    TA-->>-Tre: treasury_pda

    Tre->>+PA: derive PDA<br/>seeds = ["policy", company_pda]<br/>allocate + rent-fund
    Note over PA: zero budgets<br/>secondary_signer = None<br/>agent_operating_fee_bps = 300<br/>current_period_anchor = month_start(now)<br/>version = 1
    PA-->>-Tre: policy_pda

    Tre-->>-Reg: (treasury_pda, policy_pda)

    Reg->>CA: write back<br/>CompanyAccount.treasury = treasury_pda<br/>CompanyAccount.policy   = policy_pda

    Reg-->>-Op: tx confirmed

    Note over Op,PA: ⛓ Atomic — any failure inside the tx<br/>reverts CompanyAccount creation too.<br/>No window where Company exists with<br/>invalid Treasury/Policy pointers.
